# ERROR EXAMPLE: Insufficient memory allocation
# CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ single point on naphthalene requires many GB of RAM
# %maxcore 6 gives only 6 MB per core — far too small for coupled-cluster
# ORCA error: "ORCA finished by error termination" / memory allocation failure
# Fix: Increase %maxcore to at least 4000 (4 GB per core); check available RAM
! CCSD(T) cc-pVTZ pal16

%maxcore 6

